==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Red Wind]]s (500%) spawn, delay 11.67~13.33 seconds<sup>350f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Red Wind]]s (500%) spawn, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Red Wind]]s (500%) spawn, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A rather easy stage, even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units. The enemy serves practically no threat at all, even in large numbers. It is recommended to increase the collaboration units to at least near max level to deal with the massive amount of HP  granted by these boosts. Otherwise, [[Cat Combo]]s can help.

